只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Reuse your own logged-in Chrome in dsh (DeepSeek Harness): scrape login-walled sites, fill forms, and click through pages with native wc3_* tools — no re-login, no anti-bot friction.","id":"gh:1336121556","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-browser-use","slug":"fatmind/dsh-plugin-browser-use","topics":["ai-agent","browser-automation","chrome-extension","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","web-scraping","webclaw3"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Reuse your own logged-in Chrome in dsh (DeepSeek Harness): scrape login-walled sites, fill forms, an"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"d click through pages with native wc3_* tools — no re-login, no anti-bot friction."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-browser-use"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"🌐 中文版 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Browser automation for dsh (DeepSeek Harness).** Registers webclaw3 as native `wc3_*` tools that d"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"rive **your own logged-in Chrome** — skip re-login, auth popups, and most anti-bot walls."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Scrape & export** — search results, tables, downloads\n- **Crawl login-walled pages** — 小红书, WeCh"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"at official accounts, Weibo, Taobao, admin dashboards…\n- **Interact** — click buttons, fill forms, p"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ost content\n- **Reach SPA internals** — React fiber / Vue data / `__NEXT_DATA__`"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The plugin is a thin adapter: it translates the relay's HTTP API into dsh tools and distills webclaw"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"3's browsing philosophy (SKILL.md) into the system prompt. The engine and docs live upstream and are"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" synced via `scripts/sync-webclaw3.sh`."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> **Note:** in dsh you should **not** also install webclaw3 as a skill — this plugin already handles"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" engine loading and usage guidance. Installing both causes duplicate instructions and conflicting re"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ne loading and usage guidance. Installing both causes duplicate instructions and conflicting relays."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Prerequisites: dsh, Node >= 22, pnpm, Chrome."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Or from a local checkout:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The script installs dependencies → registers the plugin into the web profile (`link:`) → downloads &"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" unzips the wc3-chrome extension. Then:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Open `chrome://extensions`, enable **Developer mode**, and **Load unpacked** the extension folder"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" printed by the script;\n2. **Restart dsh** (profiles load at startup);\n3. Tell dsh \"check the browse"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"r environment\" — the model runs `wc3_doctor` and reports what's missing."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Re-running the installer updates the plugin."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Tool | relay op | Purpose |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| `wc3_doctor` | - | Channel self-check (Node/engine/relay/extension); auto-starts the relay |\n| `wc"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"3_tabs` | `tab.list` | List tabs and get tabIds; `[当前]`=active tab, `[默认]`=wc3's default target |\n| "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"`wc3_tab_open` | `tab.create` | Open a URL in a background tab (doesn't steal focus); becomes the ne"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"w default |\n| `wc3_tab_close` | `tab.close` | Close a tab you opened; clears the default target if i"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"t was closed |\n| `wc3_tab_activate` | `tab.list` + local state | Pin a tab as the default operation "},{"id":"p20s6","text":"target (no more \"current tab\" drift) |\n| `wc3_snapshot` | `page.ariaTree` | Aria-tree snapshot with "},{"id":"p20s7","text":"`[ref_N]` ids for interaction |\n| `wc3_get_text` | `page.getText` | Full-page plain text for reconna"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"issance |\n| `wc3_eval` | `page.eval` | Run arbitrary JS in the page; preferred for structured extrac"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"tion |\n| `wc3_click` / `wc3_fill` / `wc3_scroll_to` | `page.click` / `page.fillForm` / `page.scrollT"},{"id":"p20s10","text":"o` | Interact by `ref_N` (React/Vue-safe) |\n| `wc3_search` | `page.search` | Find page elements by k"},{"id":"p20s11","text":"eyword |\n| `wc3_wait_for` | `page.waitForElement` | Wait for an element to appear |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Page tools (snapshot/get_text/eval/click/fill/scroll_to/search/wait_for) accept `tabId` optionally"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"** — when omitted, they act on wc3's most recently active tab (newly opened, last used, or the activ"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"e tab; marked `[默认]` in `wc3_tabs`). `wc3_tab_close` keeps `tabId` required to prevent accidental cl"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"oses. If the extension briefly disconnects, tools auto-retry (self-heal within ~10s) before reportin"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"e extension briefly disconnects, tools auto-retry (self-heal within ~10s) before reporting an error."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Tool results are plain text with user-facing guidance, capped at 50,000 chars by default (configurab"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"le), truncated when exceeded."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Edit `packages/browser-use/cordis.patch.yml` after install if needed:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Field | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `relayHost` / `relayPort` | `127.0.0.1` / `3459` | Relay address |\n| `toolTimeoutMs` | `60000` | P"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"er-call timeout (ms) |\n| `maxResultChars` | `50000` | Max chars per result |\n| `autoStartRelay` | `t"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"rue` | Auto-run `webclaw3.mjs start` when the relay is down |\n| `engineDir` | `\"\"` (auto-located) | "},{"id":"p26s4","text":"Engine directory; or set `DSH_WC3_ENGINE_DIR` |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
